10. Complexity Analysis
Operation	Time Complexity
push()	O(1)
pop()	O(1) amortized
peek()	O(1) amortized
empty()	O(1)
Space	O(n)

The transfer of elements between the two stacks can take O(n) for a particular pop() or peek(), but each element is transferred at most once before being removed. Therefore, the amortized complexity is O(1).

